        "line": 725,
        "text": "def amplitude (d : OutgoingTail.TailData) (eta : ℝ) := (-linearTerm d.core eta + √(discriminant d eta)) / (2 * quadraticCoefficient d.core); it is substituted for the `amp` argument, e.g. `axial d.core (amplitude d) (y, eta)` at PulseAmplitude.lean:1353"
